@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛来到监牢后方的仓库，<br>发现就算是白天也能进去。|#0103Adv24_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——因为锁被破坏了。|#0103Adv24_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进昏暗的仓库，<br>开始调查室内。|#0103Adv24_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（来这种地方，<br>　可能什么都找不到）|#0103Adv24_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（但是，必须找到哪怕一点线索——）|#0103Adv24_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ガタッという物音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_64 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:原本以为仓库里只有她自己一个人，<br>却突然听到昏暗处传来了声响，<br>艾玛惊讶地望向声源。|#0103Adv24_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:谁！？|#0103Adv24_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……是我。|#0103Adv24_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香现身了。<br>她的表情看起来有些痛苦。|#0103Adv24_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香！？<br>我一直在找你！|#0103Adv24_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:——别靠近。|#0103Adv24_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0103Adv24_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到奈叶香举起枪，<br>艾玛的身体僵住了。|#0103Adv24_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我不相信这座监牢里的任何人。<br>一个都不信。|#0103Adv24_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的眼神比之前更加阴暗。<br>|#0103Adv24_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（奈叶香一定是<br>　躲在这里很久了……）|#0103Adv24_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香已经从监牢里<br>消失了好多天了。|#0103Adv24_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个仓库不仅宽敞，而且还有食物，<br>很适合躲藏生活。|#0103Adv24_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:为了揭露真相，我会出席审判。|#0103Adv24_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香转身离开了仓库。<br>|#0103Adv24_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛松了一口气，<br>然后继续调查仓库。|#0103Adv24_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:走了一会，<br>她在地板上发现了可疑的痕迹。|#0103Adv24_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『弾痕』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-5
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-5 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是，弹痕……？）|#0103Adv24_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想起刚才奈叶香拿枪指着她的事。<br>那时奈叶香并没有开枪。|#0103Adv24_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是什么时候留下的呢……）|#0103Adv24_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感到疑惑，同时继续寻找其他线索。|#0103Adv24_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，她发现架子上有一个被打开的箱子。|#0103Adv24_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0103Adv24_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『着火物』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-1
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-1 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:蜡烛、火柴、鞭炮……<br>有这些的话，就能放火了吧……|#0103Adv24_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回想起了招待所燃烧着的景象。|#0103Adv24_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，回想起汉娜的尸体悬挂的景象……<br>她摇了摇头。|#0103Adv24_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了忘掉那幅景象，艾玛走动起来，<br>继续探索着仓库。|#0103Adv24_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是之后并未发现什么特别的线索，<br>艾玛只好放弃，离开了仓库。|#0103Adv24_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

